      "duration_seconds": 12.18,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0072",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 517.17,
      "end_seconds": 520.45,
      "text": "Good. I always mix those 2 up over the phone.",
      "word_count": 10,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0073",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 520.97,
      "end_seconds": 522.37,
      "text": "Yes, I understand.",
      "word_count": 3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.4,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0074",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 523.87,
      "end_seconds": 527.85,
      "text": "The certificate applied successfully, so the identifier was accepted.",
      "word_count": 9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0075",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 529.87,
      "end_seconds": 531.71,
      "text": "Can we choose the seats now?",
      "word_count": 6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.84,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0076",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 533.67,
      "end_seconds": 546.33,
      "text": "The reservation is confirmed in standard economy. Seat selection can be completed from the reservation screen, so just choose two adjacent available seats and verify both directions for that, okay?",
      "word_count": 30,
      "duration_seconds": 12.66,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0077",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 548.75,
      "end_seconds": 549.35,
      "text": "Okay.",
      "word_count": 1,
      "duration_seconds": 0.6,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": true
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0078",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 551.01,
      "end_seconds": 556.97,
      "text": "So I see 16A and 16B outbound,",
      "word_count": 7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.96,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0079",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 558.19,
      "end_seconds": 563.35,
      "text": "and then 14D and 14E to return.",
      "word_count": 7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0080",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 563.85,
      "end_seconds": 570.07,
      "text": "Yes, those are adjacent pairs. Just review the aircraft map before confirming because layouts can differ.",
      "word_count": 16,
      "duration_seconds": 6.22,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0081",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 572.35,
      "end_seconds": 576.48,
      "text": "Okay, confirmed. Does the walker need a serial number?",
      "word_count": 9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0082",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 577.43,
      "end_seconds": 586.14,
      "text": "No, ma'am, not for this reservation entry. I would label it with contact information and identify it as a mobility device at the airport, just so they're aware.",
      "word_count": 30,
      "duration_seconds": 8.71,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0083",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 587.87,
      "end_seconds": 591.94,
      "text": "Okay. Uh, please, uh, give me the total one more time.",
      "word_count": 11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0084",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 592.53,
      "end_seconds": 615.77,
      "text": "No problem. That was $1,186.40 for fare, taxes, and two checked bags, plus $94.60 for that insurance. And a $200 credit was applied; the remainder was charged to the Visa on file. And that's the card I have ending in 1182.",
      "word_count": 45,
      "duration_seconds": 23.24,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0085",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 617.85,
      "end_seconds": 619.91,
      "text": "Okay, that matches my screen.",
      "word_count": 5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0086",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 620.75,
      "end_seconds": 634.99,
      "text": "Great. Okay, ma'am, and I do suggest you save the confirmation B9RT6M and review the insurance document for exclusions.",
      "word_count": 20,
      "duration_seconds": 14.24,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0087",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 636.55,
      "end_seconds": 641.15,
      "text": "I will. I, okay, I've written down the confirmation and the total.",
      "word_count": 13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0088",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 641.59,
      "end_seconds": 644.67,
      "text": "Good. Perfect. Is there anything else I can help you with today, ma'am?",
      "word_count": 14,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0089",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 645.91,
      "end_seconds": 649.41,
      "text": "No, that covers it. Thank you for being patient with me.",
      "word_count": 11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0090",
      "role": "agent",
      "start_seconds": 650.01,
      "end_seconds": 657.17,
      "text": "Oh, you're very welcome, ma'am. It's my pleasure. And thank you for choosing BlueMesa Airlines, and have a wonderful trip with your grandson.",
      "word_count": 26,
      "duration_seconds": 7.16,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": false
    },
    {
      "turn_id": "turn-0091",
      "role": "customer",
      "start_seconds": 658.71,
      "end_seconds": 659.19,
      "text": "Thank you.",
      "word_count": 2,
      "duration_seconds": 0.48,
      "is_backchannel_candidate": true
    }
  ],
